        "[G]Then I can smile [C]at Satan's rage,",
        "[Em]And face a frowning world;",
        "[Bm]And face a frowning world,",
        "[G]And face a [C]frowning world,",
        "[C/E]Then I can [G/D]smile at Satan's rage,",
